{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "8db3bddb703d49e1703c1dc0f36dddbe518d0fa4c37ec2ddb340580681def3ac", "ja": "友達になりたい", "zh": "想成为朋友", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "721a501e46703cf6a8c511a9a3e6440ed768389d16e88f1936ec3dbc4ead3884", "ja": "現実で杏奈を見かけた百合子は、思わず後を\nつけてしまう。そこで亜美・未来と出会い、\n夢で行われていた戦いの事、現実では関わっ\nてはいけない事などを教えてもらう。百合子\nはそれでも、杏奈と友達になりたいと言う。", "zh": "在现实中看到杏奈的百合子，不由得跟在了她身后。途中她遇到了亚美和未来，得知了梦中进行的战斗，以及在现实中不能与杏奈有任何接触等事情。即便如此，百合子还是说想和杏奈成为朋友。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1000_026yur", "source_sha256": "3f70ac8e06b2d1ec9fce30a12f24977e2aedacf100ca748cd19557c49c3b6916", "ja": "昨日の夢、なんだったんだろう？\nやけにリアルで……感触まで残ってるみたいな。", "zh": "昨天的梦，到底是怎么回事啊？\n真实感太强了……感觉连触感都还留着似的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "3f66a7a7540a130260ae5c0148e9abbcddc6ff4251abf1b1f28e934294929c13", "ja": "おかげで遅刻ギリギリ……図書館に寄っていく\nつもりだったのに……ん？", "zh": "多亏了这个，差点就迟到了……本来还打算顺路去一趟图书馆的……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "9cd96b13204594718571b83f749736c547870dea9aa64cb87297941a08d4a144", "ja": "っ！？　あ、あれって……！\n夢に出てきた……杏奈ちゃん！？", "zh": "咦！？那、那是……！\n梦里出现过的……杏奈！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "f6649e1fcfd0002f694eee6422d2618ae7429ce8066e856d8bda98d31d74f0da", "ja": "……。\n……よしっ。", "zh": "……\n……好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "29cad67907b3f40744a4c1c6d0ca6b69bdaae4e37a7663b0fc2b0ba703b97c10", "ja": "（ど、どうしよう？　尾行なんてして、私ってば\n何考えてるんだろ……はっ。これってストーカー！？）", "zh": "（怎、怎么办？居然跟踪别人，我到底在想什么啊……啊。这难道就是跟踪狂！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "35d5732066eed1788e866dba5ef1b678d35154d6299946865ec7f7a892b80685", "ja": "ああっ、いけない！\n見失わないようにしなきゃ……わ、わわっ！？", "zh": "啊啊，不好！\n得跟紧了，不能跟丢……哇、哇哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "aa430f3969453ff929867980b2de00d2945a57c6c4fed7697a5d33d1d8c00850", "ja": "きゃっ！？", "zh": "呀啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "aa430f3969453ff929867980b2de00d2945a57c6c4fed7697a5d33d1d8c00850", "ja": "きゃっ！？", "zh": "呀啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "08dd300883c0a5001380b14653b84e0db78b606e70b912c50a617fb8eabd05d6", "ja": "ああっ、ご、ごめんなさい！　よそ見してて！\nあの、ケガはないですか？", "zh": "啊，对、对不起！我刚才在东张西望！\n那个，你没受伤吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "17a5818770390ea12963e01eb2ba6415b09b5b580eacd2c34b5fcedc88b0488d", "ja": "ううん、こっちこそごめん！　急いでたから……\n……って、あれ？　もしかして……百合子？", "zh": "不是不是，该道歉的是我！因为我刚才走得太急了……\n……咦，等等？难道说……是百合子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1012_011ami", "source_sha256": "3a45e09a866465b576b3b8d721aa46c5e34cb693f87bb72d10991100dd817f74", "ja": "う、うあうあ～！？　昨日の新人の、ゆーりじゃん！\n陽界で会っちゃうなんて……！", "zh": "呜、哇哇～！？这不是昨天的新人，百～合吗！\n竟然会在阳界碰上……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "657c864635abffd283def29fba220cb9b78bf84918c441be48a1ba5a3106f7a9", "ja": "あっ！？　あなたたち、昨日の……！\nじゃあやっぱり、あれは夢じゃない……！？", "zh": "啊！？你们是昨天的……！\n这么说来，那果然不是梦……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "0a97675a86ebc9b462fa11b0ab5ae4cc7384f4b8692d09cc673d35da65e3c25b", "ja": "あ、ああっ、杏奈ちゃん……！\n……いなくなっちゃった……あーあ。", "zh": "啊、啊啊，杏奈……！\n……已经不见了……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1015_011ami", "source_sha256": "8200675c865fa40667319d77cd1656f952a10381b48308d44a311a9f7f5a455f", "ja": "ゆーり、もっちーのこと探してるの？\nむむむ、これはいけませんなあ……。", "zh": "百合，你在找小望吗？\n唔唔唔，这可不行呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "95650dda6aa71d1bbdd6177729ec4748f92f28639a5f65cd478f73fa21e7e795", "ja": "えっ。いけないって……な、なにが？", "zh": "诶？说不行……到、到底什么不行？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "f45193137ae726e5c4e69ea79c351dc26d18a9273233b5600ebe52b4318f50e4", "ja": "ここはセンパイの亜美が、いろいろ\n教えてあげないとなんじゃない？", "zh": "这时候不是得由前辈亚美来教你各种各样的东西吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1018_011ami", "source_sha256": "940e4d6ecdfacb23d3b41ef3758426b603f197a71e6266c71c0aa0a3997dc835", "ja": "仕方ないな～。ゆーり、ついでにみらいっちも。\nちょ～っとツラかしな♪", "zh": "真拿你没办法～。尤莉，还有未来也一起。把脸凑过来一下♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1019_011ami", "source_sha256": "0e0d249bb4193ca65aad0cbfe4f971c686be0679f5b76cbaed7d895752678790", "ja": "昨日のあの戦いは、シャドウバウトっていってね。\nこの『セプテムアーク人工島』の、まあ伝統行事かな？", "zh": "昨天那场战斗啊，叫做暗影决斗。\n算是这座\"七弧人工岛\"的传统活动吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1020_011ami", "source_sha256": "726443ae33ceb07a247160dda8c353df109721cb7559c7e68da31620e350f0e6", "ja": "夜になると、六学都・六学窓から選ばれた生徒たちが、\n闘技場に集まって戦うことになってるんだ。", "zh": "到了晚上，从六学都·六学窗选出的学生们，\n就得聚集在斗技场进行战斗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "15e2e1549f1853ba5a30deb1131773b2b9f0bd60415b0d3a349d54c80154cf07", "ja": "六学窓……カゲロウ・ユニバーシティ、暁陽（ぎょう\nよう）アカデミア、深青書院（しんせいしょいん）……", "zh": "六学窗……卡格罗大学、晓阳学院、深青书院……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1022_026yur", "source_sha256": "4b6e6d228003143151cab82bafa1766fbfc0fdfe66967158034a9680f938f5d3", "ja": "ヘリオトロープ工科学校、アルジェンタム大学府、\n煌聖（こうせい）リーガルカレッジ……の六つだよね？", "zh": "ヘリオトロープ工科学校、アルジェンタム大学府、煌聖（こうせい）リーガルカレッジ……一共六所，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "02422f48e1ff8fc733f9920e6c2736ceb65e0446954aa54f15a6f9c7467597b6", "ja": "正解♪\nちなみに私は、暁陽アカデミアね。", "zh": "答对啦♪\n顺便一提，我是晓阳学院的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1024_011ami", "source_sha256": "8f63ac5801a360532072fcac59ca1b47531a7d147e26b655b1b3fab23eabfc95", "ja": "亜美は煌聖の、風紀委員だよ。\nゆーりは、カゲロウ・ユニバーシティでしょ？", "zh": "亚美是煌圣学院的风纪委员哦。\n优里是阳炎大学的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1025_026yur", "source_sha256": "e2b10510d4ca40f11688f10fa7d29e09309414f361a51a77a8374757dc189e3a", "ja": "う、うん……！\nそっか、あれって夢じゃなかったんだ……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯……！\n原来如此……那不是梦啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "edcabf6e1ab2e4ea18c41687dd386cb4046a902063134281ff838c22d3aa5f25", "ja": "まあ、半分夢みたいかも？　あっちで傷ついても、\n朝には治ってるし。だから安心して暴れられるよ♪", "zh": "嗯，也许有一半像是在做梦吧？就算在那里受了伤，到了早上也会痊愈。所以可以放心地大闹一场啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1027_026yur", "source_sha256": "51b64d6054be5ddd2bd1407bdc89d742999c0c9da2dc67816e41f4539d755893", "ja": "そ、そうなの！？\nでも、どうして、そんな危険なことを……？", "zh": "是、是这样吗！？\n可是，为什么要做那么危险的事……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1028_011ami", "source_sha256": "6b3e149e795ceec46aa97ff2ab0582c5c3b2ad7aab3a8a63323088a10f12f1d6", "ja": "ん～、それは……あ、そうだ！　戦具の説明！\nゆーり、戦具出してみて。あのノートか、メモ帳？", "zh": "嗯～，这个嘛……啊，对了！讲讲战具！\n尤莉，你试着把战具拿出来。是那个笔记本，还是记事本？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1029_026yur", "source_sha256": "5f03b7b2250cdd3d45eb00a825b557bc76a73a07af02599a5f9d71fd6d37dc54", "ja": "えっ。出すって、どうやって？", "zh": "诶？要拿出来的话，该怎么做？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1030_014mir", "source_sha256": "f0d1451ab8accf049e23da81293c0861542a6160f1455f5a79fcbf1fd8795a53", "ja": "出ろ出ろ！って念じると、出るよ。", "zh": "只要在心里念叨“出来吧出来吧！”，就会出来哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1031_026yur", "source_sha256": "5e37edb9a1844ca11c730fbe1790e86cbb30d4e53dde89392571172795634017", "ja": "ええっ、そんな簡単なの……？\nで……出ろ出ろーっ！", "zh": "诶诶，这么简单就行了吗……？\n出……出来吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1032_null", "source_sha256": "63c9f5e88213d4af9de0c89fedfd631ad20a508ecfc5be8976b5518463f6723d", "ja": "ポンッ！", "zh": "砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1033_026yur", "source_sha256": "1acf60293ffb6297aebf23baecc4007659c7b9c3b1b835704353b9ac3c54bf51", "ja": "うわっ！？　ほ、本当に出た！\nこれ……私が昔使ってたノート……？", "zh": "哇！？真、真的出现了！\n这……是我以前用过的笔记本……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1034_011ami", "source_sha256": "43163ed4ee8a4fd351cfc16d5c191d245dd4723ae13b073bf94410c670ba3d22", "ja": "戦具をこっちの世界で出しちゃダメなんだけど、\n風紀委員の亜美がいるから、今だけ特別ね。", "zh": "虽然在原本的世界不能拿出战具，\n但因为有身为风纪委员的亚美在，就只有现在算特别通融哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1035_014mir", "source_sha256": "60c8afae8a9539f52307a46da4b2189076e2a4ca3b359b03c8b5005c0a705d05", "ja": "それ系は、大体書くと何か起こるタイプじゃないかな？\n何か書いてみなよ、百合子。", "zh": "这类东西，一般写下来就会发生点什么吧？百合子，你试着写点什么看看嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1036_026yur", "source_sha256": "974994155c31f5a78d9d92d9667b8d661ad06678fc531a03efaccd0632047235", "ja": "ええっ！？　いきなり……？　え、ええと……ハッ！\n……！　いでよ、ドラゴン！！！", "zh": "诶诶！？突然就来……？呃、呃呃……哈！\n……！出来吧，巨龙！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1037_se", "source_sha256": "71a8e02a82df8ab0801b8be14606262a8bf8df49374e837e646a87d66ea19c39", "ja": "ポコッ、ポコッ……\nポコポコポコポコポコポコ！", "zh": "咚、咚……\n咚咚咚咚咚咚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1038_011ami", "source_sha256": "509e4884d35d1c9fb660c9366e86ecf90ec6efae45046b45a73b9d740e4f629d", "ja": "ゆ、ゆーり、ストップストップ！\n辺りがぬいぐるみだらけになっちゃったよ！", "zh": "百、百合，停下停下！\n周围全都变成玩偶了啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1039_014mir", "source_sha256": "42170eba50174145b1a3ac8339b9b551d2f9d7144f1cb327da02f204f95b40a0", "ja": "そのノート、書いたものが出てくるんだ！\nすごいな～。", "zh": "那本笔记本，写下来的东西会出现！\n好厉害啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1040_026yur", "source_sha256": "429d0808262e8be8bef915fcaa2138f1067d1069e27d885dae98cbbd54fbd264", "ja": "あっ、ごめん！　楽しくて、つい……！", "zh": "啊，抱歉！因为太开心了，不小心就……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1041_011ami", "source_sha256": "a5cbbe2d948ac63225370f8d6e45d636c34268727c2ef8a204abcb5ae27de593", "ja": "ん～……これで、ひと通りわかったかな？\nゆーり、他に聞いておきたいこととかある？", "zh": "嗯～……这样一来，基本都明白了吧？\n优里，还有没有其他想提前问清楚的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1042_026yur", "source_sha256": "8529e20b5f8bf6769b46c63d902bb3a9a1b11fddacf2e659212ef339af4363fd", "ja": "えっと……杏奈ちゃんに会っちゃダメって言ったよね。\nなんで……？", "zh": "那个……你说过不可以见杏奈吧。\n为什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1043_011ami", "source_sha256": "74c546e3974d27db94a7e49c447afc3775f082bdd4b3d8594c7a4130a33e248c", "ja": "あ、それも言っとかないと！　うんとね、\n陽の世界では、亜美たちは会わない方がいいんだよ。", "zh": "啊，这个也得说清楚才行！嗯，因为在阳之世界里，亚美她们还是不要见面比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1044_011ami", "source_sha256": "8c8b656b7a37d2e5a6207f3b0b397b801d934168135a596f248e6894c64dbfb7", "ja": "あっちでのことは、こっちに持ち込んじゃダメ。\nこっちでも戦おうとする人がいるから。", "zh": "在那边发生的事情，可不能带到这边来。\n因为也有人想在这边继续战斗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1045_014mir", "source_sha256": "49653fbc85f09880240370e153206590ebe95fbf8c10a64ed92918117fecc4e6", "ja": "勝つためにはなんでもする、って人もいるんだよね。\n亜美たち風紀委員のお仕事が増えて困るんだって。", "zh": "也有人为了获胜什么都做得出来呢。听说这样一来，亚美她们这些风纪委员的工作就增加了，很伤脑筋。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1046_026yur", "source_sha256": "4074928add4a66750fb5164684d9af701d9201eb626f8c5973318bbac3095845", "ja": "そんな！　私、そんなことしないよ。\nただ、助けてもらったお礼を言いたいだけで……。", "zh": "才不是！我才不会做那种事呢。只是想向她道谢，感谢她帮了我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1047_026yur", "source_sha256": "44aece0c0d44697387d36df52170f0f0759f79a16c46c3f7ab6a9e7def7a262d", "ja": "杏奈ちゃん、すごくカッコよくて、綺麗だった。\n戦うとかじゃなくて、友達になれたらいいのに……。", "zh": "杏奈，真的很帅气，也很漂亮。要是不战斗，而是能成为朋友就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1048_011ami", "source_sha256": "027780203170dda2181cd5b69d1228a506f54a8219e88014b5fd9158cd070ddc", "ja": "……ほほう。", "zh": "……吼吼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1049_014mir", "source_sha256": "027780203170dda2181cd5b69d1228a506f54a8219e88014b5fd9158cd070ddc", "ja": "……ほほう。", "zh": "……吼吼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1050_026yur", "source_sha256": "f527a69e7a4ebf0218f610c20d014cbaedf437cf8ed43de93a2e74450ea1dd14", "ja": "あっ。ふ、ふたりには、\n変に聞こえちゃったかもだけど……！", "zh": "啊。对、对你们两位来说，\n听起来可能有点奇怪……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1051_011ami", "source_sha256": "a2944407c679323d24b035bcc8131070c021f7d5c7c3db97334add61ab8d2c2b", "ja": "もっちーは、陰界では有名人だよ。\nすっごく強いからね。みらいっちと並ぶんじゃない？", "zh": "莫奇在阴界可是名人哦。因为她特别强。说不定能和未来不相上下吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1052_014mir", "source_sha256": "2784123ed113b990cc827ab7f48a840eef855f540870079e7ee09997db8f2fe8", "ja": "でへへ～♪　でも、私たちもそれくらいしか\n知らないかな。陽の世界での情報はね。", "zh": "嘿嘿～♪ 不过，我们也就知道这么多了。关于阳界的信息呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1053_014mir", "source_sha256": "e6872f1466593e92f86d1a3b31acead4d4753990ea68bb9b5c8efd4ffda18bae", "ja": "だから……杏奈のこといっぱい知りたいなら、\nやっぱり直接会うしかないと思う。", "zh": "所以……如果想多了解杏奈的事，我觉得果然还是只能直接去见她。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_02_1054_014mir", "source_sha256": "6fb312934d0c91a566e173ee549b9538451474549b7c8abfc40f44fe504eddd4", "ja": "百合子、行っちゃいなよ。\n杏奈の通う、アルジェンタム大学府に！", "zh": "百合子，去吧。\n去杏奈就读的阿尔真塔姆大学府！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
